task_text:
Fix this JavaScript function that mutates the original array unintentionally.

function sortDescending(arr) {
  return arr.sort((a, b) => b - a);
}

answer:
`Array.prototype.sort` mutates in place. Clone the array first to avoid side effects.

```javascript
function sortDescending(arr) {
  return [...arr].sort((a, b) => b - a);
}
```

